<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ender Ember"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="TV动画《Re：从零开始的异世界生活 第四季》片尾曲"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MYTH &amp; ROID"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Re:ZERO Music"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TK from Ling tosite sigure"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TK from 凛として時雨"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ender Ember"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ender Ember - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPD732600179"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3371356880"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000gZKmp2zXmXg"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="657692108"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5US7QZzPMx25DnA2SW0jAW"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1893501615"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:40.660"><div begin="14.560" end="3:40.660"><p begin="14.560" end="16.440" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.560" end="15.020">The</span> <span begin="15.020" end="15.370">en</span><span begin="15.370" end="15.400">d</span> <span begin="15.400" end="15.540">i</span><span begin="15.540" end="15.680">s</span> <span begin="15.680" end="15.960">dis</span><span begin="15.960" end="16.390">tan</span><span begin="16.390" end="16.440">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终点依然遥不可及</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終點依然遙不可及</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">終わりはまだ遠い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝은 아득하게 멀어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La fin est lointaine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El final está distante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Ende ist fern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O fim está distante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Конец еще далек</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La fine è distante</span></p><p begin="16.870" end="21.620" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.870" end="17.030">Lo</span><span begin="17.030" end="17.190">st</span> <span begin="17.190" end="17.540">in</span> <span begin="17.540" end="17.740">de</span><span begin="17.740" end="18.030">ser</span><span begin="18.030" end="18.180">t</span> <span begin="18.180" end="18.510">sand</span><span begin="18.510" end="18.610">s,</span> <span begin="18.730" end="18.890">wi</span><span begin="18.890" end="19.050">th</span> <span begin="19.050" end="19.380">no</span> <span begin="19.380" end="19.650">gui</span><span begin="19.650" end="20.040">ding</span> <span begin="20.040" end="20.320">pa</span><span begin="20.320" end="20.360">th</span> <span begin="20.360" end="20.520">a</span><span begin="20.520" end="21.620">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷失在狂沙之中 前路毫无指引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">迷失在狂沙之中 前路毫無指引</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">導く道もなく 砂漠の砂に迷い込む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사막의 모래 속에 길을 잃고, 앞을 이끌어줄 길도 없이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdue dans les sables du désert sans aucun chemin pour me guider</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Perdida en las arenas del desierto, sin un camino que me guíe por delante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verloren im Wüstensand ohne einen Wegweiser voraus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdida nas areias do deserto, sem nenhum caminho a seguir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потеряна в песках пустыни без путеводной нити впереди</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persa nelle sabbie del deserto senza alcun sentiero a guidarmi</span></p><p begin="22.370" end="26.000" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.370" end="22.720">In</span> <span begin="22.720" end="23.010">my</span> <span begin="23.010" end="23.300">heart,</span> <span begin="23.300" end="23.470">a</span> <span begin="23.470" end="23.630">s</span><span begin="23.630" end="23.910">torm</span> <span begin="24.020" end="24.090">o</span><span begin="24.090" end="24.180">f</span> <span begin="24.180" end="24.580">fee</span><span begin="24.580" end="24.740">ling</span><span begin="24.740" end="24.940">s</span> <span begin="24.940" end="25.200">a</span><span begin="25.200" end="25.610">ri</span><span begin="25.830" end="26.000">ses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心中 掀起情感的风暴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的心中 掀起情感的風暴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">胸の内に 感情の嵐が巻き起こる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 마음속엔, 감정의 폭풍이 일어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans mon cœur une tempête de sentiments s&apos;élève</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En mi corazón, se levanta una tormenta de sentimientos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In meinem Herzen zieht ein Sturm der Gefühle auf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em meu coração, surge uma tempestade de sentimentos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В моем сердце поднимается буря чувств</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nel mio cuore si solleva una tempesta di sentimenti</span></p><p begin="26.000" end="29.490" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.000" end="26.260">Yet</span> <span begin="26.540" end="26.760">one</span> <span begin="26.940" end="27.210">grain</span> <span begin="27.440" end="27.590">o</span><span begin="27.590" end="27.710">f</span> <span begin="27.710" end="28.100">hope</span> <span begin="28.100" end="28.250">re</span><span begin="28.370" end="28.650">main</span><span begin="28.650" end="28.790">s</span> <span begin="28.790" end="29.370">he</span><span begin="29.370" end="29.490">re</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而这里 仍残存着一缕希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">然而這裡 仍殘存著一縷希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも一粒の希望がここに残る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 한 알의 희망이 이곳에 남아있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourtant un seul grain d&apos;espoir subsiste ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sin embargo un grano de esperanza permanece aquí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch ein Körnchen Hoffnung bleibt hier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda assim um grão de esperança permanece aqui</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но здесь остается еще одна крупица надежды</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure qui rimane un granello di speranza</span></p><p begin="29.990" end="33.380" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.990" end="30.430">永</span><span begin="30.670" end="31.150">遠</span><span begin="31.360" end="31.500">と</span><span begin="31.600" end="32.080">見</span><span begin="32.080" end="32.620">紛</span><span begin="32.620" end="32.740">う</span><span begin="32.740" end="32.990">闇</span><span begin="32.990" end="33.380">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与那仿佛化作永恒的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與那彷彿化作永恆的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With darkness mistaken for eternity</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">영원이라 착각할 듯한 어둠과</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec des ténèbres qu&apos;on prendrait pour l&apos;éternité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con una oscuridad que se confunde con la eternidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Dunkelheit die man mit der Ewigkeit verwechselt und</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com a escuridão que se confunde com a eternidade e</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тьма которую можно принять за вечность и</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con un&apos;oscurità che si confonde con l&apos;eternità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Eien to mimagau yami to</span></p><p begin="33.680" end="37.110" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.680" end="33.920">孤</span><span begin="33.920" end="34.610">独</span><span begin="34.610" end="34.800">が</span><span begin="35.060" end="35.680">疼</span><span begin="35.680" end="35.800">く</span><span begin="35.800" end="36.010">伽</span><span begin="36.010" end="36.660">藍</span><span begin="36.660" end="37.110">堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以及孤独隐隐作痛的空洞躯壳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">以及孤獨隱隱作痛的空洞軀殼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">An empty shell where loneliness aches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고독이 쑤셔오는 텅 빈 공간</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une salle vide où la solitude me fait souffrir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y un vacío donde duele la soledad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine leere Hülle in der die Einsamkeit schmerzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O vazio onde a solidão lateja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пустота ноющая от одиночества</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un tempio vuoto dove pulsa la solitudine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kodoku ga uzuku garandou</span></p><p begin="37.350" end="40.590" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.350" end="37.470">ゆ</span><span begin="37.470" end="37.610">ら</span><span begin="37.610" end="37.840">り</span><span begin="38.050" end="38.170">揺</span><span begin="38.170" end="38.310">れ</span><span begin="38.310" end="38.560">て</span><span begin="38.760" end="38.890">揺</span><span begin="38.890" end="39.020">れ</span><span begin="39.020" end="39.240">る</span><span begin="39.440" end="39.720">君</span><span begin="39.720" end="39.910">の</span><span begin="40.090" end="40.390">声</span><span begin="40.390" end="40.590">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你那摇曳不定 飘忽的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是你那搖曳不定 飄忽的聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">By your swaying swaying swaying voice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아른아른 흔들리며 요동치는 너의 목소리에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par ta voix qui vacille et tremble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por tu voz que oscila temblando temblando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Von deiner Stimme die sanft schwankt und bebt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Na sua voz que balança e balança suavemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Твой голос что так мягко и плавно звучит</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dalla tua voce che tremola e oscilla dolcemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yurari yurete yureru kimi no koe ni</span></p><p begin="40.820" end="44.400" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.820" end="41.060">生</span><span begin="41.280" end="41.490">か</span><span begin="41.710" end="41.990">さ</span><span begin="42.220" end="42.420">れ</span><span begin="42.420" end="42.660">て</span><span begin="42.660" end="42.860">い</span><span begin="42.860" end="43.160">た</span> <span begin="43.160" end="43.460">Mid</span><span begin="43.620" end="44.400">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我在那午夜 苟延残喘至今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓我在那午夜 苟延殘喘至今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I was kept alive Midnight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">生かされていた 真夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살아갈 수 있었어, 이 깊은 밤을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai été maintenue en vie à minuit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me mantenía con vida en la medianoche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wurde ich am Leben gehalten um Mitternacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu fui mantida viva Midnight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сохранял мне жизнь в эту полночь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Venivo tenuta in vita a mezzanotte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikasarete ita Midnight</span></p><p begin="44.750" end="46.400" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="44.750" end="44.970">果</span><span begin="44.970" end="45.170">て</span><span begin="45.170" end="45.440">し</span><span begin="45.440" end="45.610">な</span><span begin="45.610" end="45.750">い</span><span begin="45.750" end="46.130">光</span><span begin="46.130" end="46.400">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无边无际的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無邊無際的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Endless scene</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없는 광경</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un paysage sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un paisaje interminable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein endloser Anblick</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cenário sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бескрайние пейзажи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno scenario sconfinato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hateshinai koukei</span></p><p begin="46.620" end="48.180" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="46.620" end="46.920">懐</span><span begin="47.060" end="47.150">か</span><span begin="47.260" end="47.610">しい</span><span begin="47.610" end="47.970">情</span><span begin="47.970" end="48.180">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人怀念的情景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">令人懷念的情景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Nostalgic sight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리운 정경</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une scène nostalgique</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una escena nostálgica</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine nostalgische Szene</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cena nostálgica</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Знакомые до боли сцены</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una scena nostalgica</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Natsukashii joukei</span></p><p begin="48.420" end="50.050" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="48.420" end="48.660">た</span><span begin="48.660" end="48.840">だ</span><span begin="48.840" end="49.320">一</span><span begin="49.320" end="49.480">つ</span><span begin="49.480" end="49.730">だ</span><span begin="49.830" end="50.050">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有那唯一的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯有那唯一的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Only one thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오직 단 하나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Juste une seule chose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo hay una cosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur eines allein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas um único</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И лишь одна</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Soltanto uno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada hitotsu dake</span></p><p begin="50.290" end="51.920" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="50.290" end="50.480">待</span><span begin="50.480" end="50.740">ち</span><span begin="50.740" end="51.180">望</span><span begin="51.180" end="51.300">む</span><span begin="51.300" end="51.920">夢…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所期盼的梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我所期盼的夢境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The dream I long for...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고대하는 꿈…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le rêve que j&apos;attendais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El sueño que tanto anhelo…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der lang ersehnte Traum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sonho que anseio...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Желанная мечта</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il sogno che attendo con ansia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Machinozomu yume…</span></p><p begin="53.060" end="57.800" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="53.060" end="53.500">限</span><span begin="53.500" end="53.780">り</span><span begin="53.780" end="54.200">の</span><span begin="54.200" end="54.650">無</span><span begin="54.650" end="54.960">い</span><span begin="54.960" end="55.850">時</span><span begin="55.850" end="56.290">を</span><span begin="56.290" end="56.720">越</span><span begin="56.720" end="56.950">え</span><span begin="56.950" end="57.190">て</span><span begin="57.190" end="57.800">今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨越无尽的光阴 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">跨越無盡的光陰 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Crossing over limitless time now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없는 시간을 넘어 지금</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Traversant un temps infini maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cruzando ahora el tiempo ilimitado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt die grenzenlose Zeit überwindend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cruzando o tempo sem limites agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml