="1:04.580" end="1:04.840">sion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是漆黑的情感 也是连结向你的热情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕是漆黑的情感 也是連結向你的熱情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even black emotions are the Passion connecting to you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">黒い感情も 君へ繋ぐ情熱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">검은 감정도 너에게 이어지는 열정</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même ces émotions noires sont une passion qui me lie à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso los sentimientos negros son una pasión que me conecta a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch schwarze Gefühle sind eine Passion die mich mit dir verbindet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até as emoções sombrias são a Passion que me conecta a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже темные эмоции это страсть связывающая меня с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche i sentimenti oscuri sono una passione che mi lega a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuroi kanjou mo kimi e tsunagu Passion</span></p><p begin="1:05.050" end="1:09.090" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:05.050" end="1:05.170">だ</span><span begin="1:05.170" end="1:05.310">か</span><span begin="1:05.310" end="1:05.430">ら</span><span begin="1:05.530" end="1:05.740">どう</span><span begin="1:05.740" end="1:05.940">か</span><span begin="1:05.940" end="1:06.230">す</span><span begin="1:06.230" end="1:06.450">べ</span><span begin="1:06.450" end="1:06.660">て</span> <span begin="1:06.910" end="1:07.360">愛</span><span begin="1:07.360" end="1:07.800">し</span><span begin="1:07.800" end="1:07.970">て</span><span begin="1:07.970" end="1:08.280">欲</span><span begin="1:08.470" end="1:09.090">しい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以求求你 将这一切全盘接纳吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以求求你 將這一切全盤接納吧</span><span ttm:r