640">無</span><span begin="1:20.640" end="1:20.730">い</span><span begin="1:20.730" end="1:21.200">想</span><span begin="1:21.200" end="1:21.490">い</span> <span begin="1:21.650" end="1:22.130">君</span><span begin="1:22.130" end="1:22.610">へ</span><span begin="1:22.610" end="1:22.900">と</span><span begin="1:23.000" end="1:23.930">捧</span><span begin="1:23.930" end="1:24.000">ぐ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这份毫无回报的思念 尽数奉献于你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將這份毫無回報的思念 盡數奉獻於你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Unrewarded feelings I dedicate to you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">보답받지 못할 마음을 너에게 바쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces sentiments sans récompense je te les dédie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te dedico estos sentimientos sin recompensa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Diese unbelohnten Gefühle widme ich dir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dedico a você esses sentimentos sem recompensa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Безответные чувства я посвящаю тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dedico a te questi sentimenti non corrisposti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mukui no nai omoi kimi e to sasagu</span></p><p begin="1:28.860" end="1:30.360" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.860" end="1:29.320">もう</span><span begin="1:29.320" end="1:29.440">行</span><span begin="1:29.440" end="1:29.550">き</span><span begin="1:29.550" end="1:29.670">場</span><span begin="1:29.670" end="1:29.780">の</span><span begin="1:29.780" end="1:29.890">な</span><span begin="1:29.890" end="1:29.980">い</span><span begin="1:29.980" end="1:30.090">思</span><span begin="1:30.090" end="1:30.360">考</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已然无处安放的思绪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">已然無處安放的思緒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Thoughts with nowhere left to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더 이상 갈 곳 없는 사고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des pensées qui n&apos;ont plus nulle part où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pensamientos que ya no tienen adónde ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gedanken die nirgendwohin mehr können</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pensamentos que já não têm para onde ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мысли которым больше некуда деться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Pensieri che non hanno più un posto dove andare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou ikiba no nai shikou</span></p><p begin="1:30.470" end="1:31.820" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.470" end="1:30.690">曖</span><span begin="1:30.690" end="1:30.910">昧</span><span begin="1:30.910" end="1:31.020">な</span><span begin="1:31.130" end="1:31.480">絶</span><span begin="1:31.480" end="1:31.820">望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暧昧不清的绝望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曖昧不清的絕望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Ambiguous despair</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">애매한 절망</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un désespoir ambigu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una desesperación ambigua</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vage Verzweiflung</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desespero ambíguo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смутное отчаяние</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una disperazione ambigua</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aimai na zetsubou</span></p><p begin="1:32.520" end="1:35.430" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.520" end="1:33.000">Oh</span> <span begin="1:33.000" end="1:33.240">暴</span><span begin="1:33.240" end="1:33.370">れ</span><span begin="1:33.370" end="1:33.500">る</span><span begin="1:33.500" end="1:33.790">感</span><span begin="1:33.790" end="1:34.020">情</span><span begin="1:34.020" end="1:34.050">、</span><span begin="1:34.110" end="1:34.360">焦</span><span begin="1:34.360" end="1:34.610">燥</span><span begin="1:34.610" end="1:34.730">を</span><span begin="1:34.840" end="1:35.060">どう</span><span begin="1:35.060" end="1:35.170">し</span><span begin="1:35.170" end="1:35.430">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 这狂暴的情感与焦躁 该如何是好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 這狂暴的情感與焦躁 該如何是好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh what should I do with these raging emotions, this impatience</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 暴れる感情 焦燥をどうしよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 날뛰는 감정, 초조함을 어떡하지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh ces émotions violentes que faire de cette frustration</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh estas emociones desbocadas, qué hago con esta impaciencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh wütende Gefühle was soll ich mit dieser Ungeduld tun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Oh emoções violentas, o que fazer com essa frustração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ох бушующие эмоции что же делать с этой тревогой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh cosa dovrei fare con queste emozioni violente e questa frustrazione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Oh abareru kanjou, shousou o dou shiyou</span></p><p begin="1:36.270" end="1:37.630" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:36.270" end="1:36.670">No</span> <span begin="1:36.670" end="1:36.860">止</span><span begin="1:36.860" end="1:36.940">め</span><span begin="1:36.940" end="1:37.020">ら</span><span begin="1:37.020" end="1:37.160">れ</span><span begin="1:37.160" end="1:37.250">な</span><span begin="1:37.250" end="1:37.390">い</span><span begin="1:37.390" end="1:37.490">過</span><span begin="1:37.490" end="1:37.630">剰</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 这是无法抑制的过载</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不 這是無法抑制的過載</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">No unstoppable excess</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">いや 止められない過剰</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아니 멈출 수 없는 과잉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Non un excès incontrôlable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No un exceso que no se puede detener</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nein ein unaufhaltsamer Überschuss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No excesso incontrolável</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нет это неудержимый переизбыток</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">No un eccesso inarrestabile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">No tomerarenai kajou</span></p><p begin="1:37.820" end="1:39.510" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.820" end="1:38.090">混</span><span begin="1:38.090" end="1:38.270">沌</span><span begin="1:38.270" end="1:38.500">そ</span><span begin="1:38.500" end="1:38.740">れ</span><span begin="1:38.740" end="1:38.890">以</span><span begin="1:38.890" end="1:39.510">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比混沌还要更加混沌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">比混沌還要更加混沌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Chaos more than that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">혼돈 그 이상</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le chaos et bien plus encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Más allá del caos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mehr als nur Chaos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Caos e muito mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хаос и даже больше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Più del caos</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konton sore ijou</span></p><p begin="1:39.890" end="1:41.430" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:39.890" end="1:40.280">Though</span> <span begin="1:40.380" end="1:40.630">確</span><span begin="1:40.630" end="1:40.730">か</span><span begin="1:40.730" end="1:40.810">な</span><span begin="1:40.810" end="1:41.170">切</span><span begin="1:41.170" end="1:41.430">望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而 却是无比真切的渴望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">然而 卻是無比真切的渴望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Though a certain longing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも 確かな切望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 확실한 갈망</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourtant un désir certain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque es un anhelo certero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dennoch ein tiefes Verlangen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Though desejo ardente e certo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же это несомненная жажда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sebbene sia un desiderio certo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Though tashika na setsubou</span></p><p begin="1:41.520" end="1:42.910" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:41.520" end="1:41.620">た</span><span begin="1:41.620" end="1:41.720">だ</span><span begin="1:41.720" end="1:41.870">じ</span><span begin="1:41.870" end="1:41.980">っ</span><span begin="1:41.980" end="1:42.110">と</span><span begin="1:42.110" end="1:42.370">抱</span><span begin="1:42.370" end="1:42.440">く</span><span begin="1:42.440" end="1:42.570">希</span><span begin="1:42.570" end="1:42.910">望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是静静怀抱着的希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只是靜靜懷抱著的希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A hope I just quietly embrace</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 가만히 품은 희망</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Gardant juste l&apos;espoir en silence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una esperanza que solo abrazo en silencio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Hoffnung die ich einfach still umarme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A esperança que apenas abraço em silêncio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Надежда которую я просто тихо обнимаю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una speranza che nutro in silenzio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada jitto daku kibou</span></p><p begin="1:43.090" end="1:44.970" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.090" end="1:43.550">How</span> <span begin="1:43.550" end="1:43.890">far</span> <span begin="1:43.890" end="1:44.290">from</span> <span begin="1:44.290" end="1:44.540">you</span> <span begin="1:44.540" end="1:44.970">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我距离你还有多远</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">此刻我距離你還有多遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今 君からどれほど遠いのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 너에게서 얼마나 멀리 떨어져 있는 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À quelle distance de toi suis-je maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Qué tan lejos de ti estoy ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie weit bin ich nun von dir entfernt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A que distância estou de você agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как же далеко я сейчас от тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quanto sono lontana da te ora</span></p><p begin="1:45.450" end="1:50.450" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.450" end="1:45.760">And</span> <span begin="1:45.760" end="1:46.170">grain</span> <span begin="1:46.170" end="1:46.400">by</span> <span begin="1:46.400" end="1:46.840">grain,</span> <span begin="1:46.840" end="1:47.250">the</span> <span begin="1:47.250" end="1:47.520">sand</span> <span begin="1:47.620" end="1:47.960">ga</span><span begin="1:47.960" end="1:48.130">ther</span><span begin="1:48.130" end="1:48.240">s</span> <span begin="1:48.240" end="1:48.670">in</span> <span begin="1:48.670" end="1:49.060">the</span> <span begin="1:49.160" end="1:50.420">win</span><span begin="1:50.420" end="1:50.450">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">砂砾在狂风中 粒粒聚积</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">砂礫在狂風中 粒粒聚積</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">一粒また一粒 風の中で砂が集まっていく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 한 알 한 알, 모래가 바람에 모여들어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et grain par grain le sable s&apos;amasse dans le vent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y grano a grano, la arena se acumula en el viento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und Korn für Korn sammelt sich der Sand im Wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E grão por grão, a areia se acumula no vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И песчинка за песчинкой песок собирается на ветру</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E granello dopo granello la sabbia si raccoglie nel vento</span></p><p begin="1:50.980" end="1:54.220" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.980" end="1:51.290">This</span> <span begin="1:51.290" end="1:51.700">fee</span><span begin="1:51.700" end="1:51.880">ling&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:51.880" end="1:52.210">so</span> <span begin="1:52.210" end="1:52.580">pure</span> <span begin="1:52.580" end="1:52.790">it</span> <span begin="1:52.790" end="1:53.010">dri</span><span begin="1:53.010" end="1:53.160">ves</span> <span begin="1:53.160" end="1:53.490">me</span> <span begin="1:53.490" end="1:53.740">more</span> <span begin="1:53.740" end="1:54.190">ma</span><span begin="1:54.190" end="1:54.220">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份感情如此纯粹 反而令我愈发疯狂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這份感情如此純粹 反而令我愈發瘋狂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この想いはあまりに純粋で さらに私を狂わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 감정은 너무나 순수해서 날 더욱 미치게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce sentiment est si pur qu&apos;il me rend encore plus folle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Este sentimiento es tan puro que me vuelve más loca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieses Gefühl ist so rein dass es mich noch mehr in den Wahnsinn treibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse sentimento é tão puro que me deixa mais louca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это чувство настолько чистое что сводит меня с ума еще сильнее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo sentimento è così puro che mi fa impazzire ancora di più</span></p><p begin="1:54.680" end="1:57.970" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.680" end="1:54.960">And</span> <span begin="1:55.160" end="1:55.400">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:55.620" end="1:55.850">do</span> <span begin="1:56.070" end="1:56.300">a</span><span begin="1:56.300" end="1:56.650">ny</span><span begin="1:56.770" end="1:56.960">thing</span> <span begin="1:56.960" end="1:57.180">for</span> <span begin="1:57.180" end="1:57.320">your</span> <span begin="1:57.460" end="1:57.910">lo</span><span begin="1:57.910" end="1:57.970">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你的爱 我愿倾尽所有</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為了你的愛 我願傾盡所有</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君の愛のためなら 何だってする</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너의 사랑을 위해서라면 난 뭐든 할 텐데</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et je ferais n&apos;importe quoi pour ton amour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y haría cualquier cosa por tu amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und ich würde alles für deine Liebe tun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E eu faria qualquer coisa pelo seu amor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И я сделаю всё ради твоей любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E farei qualsiasi cosa per il tuo amore</span></p><p begin="1:58.600" end="2:00.190" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:58.600" end="1:58.930">懐</span><span begin="1:59.040" end="1:59.200">か</span><span begin="1:59.300" end="1:59.520">し</span><span begin="1:59.520" end="1:59.640">む</span><span begin="1:59.640" end="1:59.880">だ</span><span begin="2:00.010" end="2:00.190">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅是怀念</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">僅僅是懷念</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just feeling nostalgic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리워할 뿐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Juste ressentir de la nostalgie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo recordar con nostalgia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sich nur zu sehnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas sentindo saudades</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Просто вспоминать с тоской</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo provando nostalgia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Natsukashimu dake</span></p><p begin="2:00.430" end="2:02.030" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:00.430" end="2:00.970">慈</span><span begin="2:01.080" end="2:01.370">し</span><span begin="2:01.370" end="2:01.470">む</span><span begin="2:01.470" end="2:01.730">だ</span><span begin="2:01.830" end="2:02.030">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅是怜爱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">僅僅是憐愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just cherishing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">애지중지할 뿐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Juste chérir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo amar tiernamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur zu hegen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas sentindo carinho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Просто лелеять в сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo provando affetto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsukushimu dake</span></p><p begin="2:02.240" end="2:03.870" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:02.240" end="2:02.520">そ</span><span begin="2:02.520" end="2:02.630">れ</span><span begin="2:02.760" end="2:02.850">だ</span><span begin="2:03.000" end="2:03.200">け</span><span begin="2:03.200" end="2:03.320">じゃ</span><span begin="2:03.320" end="2:03.550">到</span><span begin="2:03.680" end="2:03.870">底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅是这样 到底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">僅僅是這樣 到底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just that is absolutely</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그것만으론 도저히</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec seulement cela c&apos;est absolument</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo con eso no puedo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das allein reicht absolut nicht aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só com isso de forma alguma</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одного этого мне ни за что</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo con questo non potrò mai</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore dake ja toutei</span></p><p begin="2:04.140" end="2:05.880" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:04.140" end="2:04.270">満</span><span begin="2:04.370" end="2:04.560">た</span><span begin="2:04.560" end="2:04.840">さ</span><span begin="2:04.840" end="2:05.030">れ</span><span begin="2:05.190" end="2:05.560">な</span><span begin="2:05.560" end="2:05.880">い…</span><span ttm:role="x-t