:11.990">余</span><span begin="2:11.990" end="2:12.490">る</span><span begin="2:12.490" end="2:13.370">愛</span><span begin="2:13.370" end="2:13.670">の</span><span begin="2:13.820" end="2:14.610">迷</span><span begin="2:14.610" end="2:14.740">う</span><span begin="2:14.740" end="2:14.970">ま</span><span begin="2:14.970" end="2:15.540">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任由过剩的爱意迷失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">任由過剩的愛意迷失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Remaining lost in this overflowing love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넘쳐나는 사랑에 헤매는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdue dans un amour surabondant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras este amor desbordante sigue perdido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während ich mich in dieser überfließenden Liebe verirre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdida neste amor que transborda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Продолжая блуждать в этой избыточной любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perdendomi in questo amore traboccante</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ariamaru ai no mayou mama</span></p><p begin="2:22.560" end="2:24.210" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:22.560" end="2:22.680">果</span><span begin="2:22.800" end="2:22.900">て</span><span begin="2:23.010" end="2:23.250">し</span><span begin="2:23.250" end="2:23.400">な</span><span begin="2:23.400" end="2:23.580">い</span><span begin="2:23.580" end="2:23.980">光</span><span begin="2:23.980" end="2:24.210">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无边无际的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無邊無際的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Endless scene</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없는 광경</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un paysage sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un paisaje interminable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein endloser Anblick</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cenário sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бескрайние пейзажи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno scenario sconfinato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hateshinai koukei</span></p><p begin="2:24.440" end="2:26.040" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:24.440" end="2:24.760">懐</span><span begin="2:24.870" end="2:24.970">か</span><span begin="2:25.080" end="2:25.440">しい</span><span begin="2:25.440" end="2:25.730">情</span><span begin="2:25.830" end="2:26.040">景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人怀念的情景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">令人懷念的情景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Nostalgic sight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리운 정경</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une scène nostalgique</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una escena nostálgica</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine nostalgische Szene</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cena nostálgica</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Знакомые до боли сцены</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una scena nostalgica</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Natsukashii joukei</span></p><p begin="2:26.300" end="2:27.850" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:26.300" end="2:26.500">た</span><span begin="2:26.500" end="2:26.680">だ</span><span begin="2:26.680" end="2:27.160">一</span><span begin="2:27.160" end="2:27.290">つ</span><span begin="2:27.290" end="2:27.640">だ</span><span begin="2:27.640" end="2:27.850">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有那唯一的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯有那唯一的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Only one thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오직 단 하나</spa