><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Remaining lost in this overflowing love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넘쳐나는 사랑에 헤매는 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdue dans un amour surabondant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras este amor desbordante sigue perdido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während ich mich in dieser überfließenden Liebe verirre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdida neste amor que transborda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Продолжая блуждать в этой избыточной любви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perdendomi in questo amore traboccante</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ariamaru ai no mayou mama</span></p><p begin="3:14.240" end="3:17.730" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.240" end="3:14.760">黒</span><span begin="3:14.760" end="3:14.940">い</span><span begin="3:14.940" end="3:15.290">感</span><span begin="3:15.290" end="3:15.660">情</span><span begin="3:15.660" end="3:15.840">も</span> <span begin="3:16.120" end="3:16.350">君</span><span begin="3:16.350" end="3:16.540">へ</span><span begin="3:16.540" end="3:17.010">繋</span><span begin="3:17.010" end="3:17.120">ぐ</span> <span begin="3:17.120" end="3:17.470">Pas</span><span begin="3:17.470" end="3:17.730">sion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是漆黑的情感 也是连结向你的热情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哪怕是漆黑的情感 也是連結向你的熱情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even black emotions are the Passion connecting to you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">黒い感情も 君へ繋ぐ情熱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">검은 감정도 너에게 이어지는 열정</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même ces émotions noires sont une passion qui me lie à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso los sentimientos negros son una pasión que me conecta a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch schwarze Gefühle sind eine Passion die mich mit dir verbindet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até as emoções sombrias são a Passion que me conecta a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже темные эмоции это страсть связывающая меня с тобой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche i sentimenti oscuri sono una passione che mi lega a te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuroi kanjou mo kimi e tsunagu Passion</span></p><p begin="3:17.970" end="3:21.400" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.970" end="3:18.230">盲</span><span begin="3:18.230" end="3:18.510">目</span><span begin="3:18.700" end="3:19.040">的</span><span begin="3:19.040" end="3:19.380">願</span><span begin="3:19.380" end="3:19.590">望</span> <span begin="3:19.850" end="3:20.040">永</span><span begin="3:20.040" end="3:20.280">遠</span><span begin="3:20.280" end="3:20.490">の</span> <span begin="3:20.490" end="3:20.800">De</span><span begin="3:20.800" end="3:21.170">vo</span><span begin="3:21.170" end="3:21.400">tion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盲目的愿望 永恒的奉献</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盲目的願望 永恆的奉獻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Blind desire eternal Devotion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">盲目的願望 永遠の献身</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">맹목적 소망 영원한 헌신</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un désir aveugle une dévotion éternelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un deseo ciego una devoción eterna</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein blinder Wunsch diese ewige Devotion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Desejo cego Devotion eterna</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слепое желание вечная преданность</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Desiderio cieco una devozione eterna</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mouteki ganbou eien no Devotion</span></p><p begin="3:21.640" end="3:25.600" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:21.640" end="3:21.880">こ</span><span begin="3:21.880" end="3:22.130">れ</span><span begin="3:22.130" end="3:22.570">が</span><span begin="3:22.570" end="3:23.070">最</span><span begin="3:23.070" end="3:23.540">期</span><span begin="3:23.540" end="3:23.860">に</span><span begin="3:24.030" end="3:24.360">な</span><span begin="3:24.360" end="3:24.440">っ</span><span begin="3:24.440" end="3:24.750">た</span><span begin="3:24.750" end="3:24.930">っ</span><span begin="3:24.930" end="3:25.140">て</span><span begin="3:25.140" end="3:25.600">いい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便这就是最后一次也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便這就是最後一次也無妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s fine even if this becomes the end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 마지막이 된다 해도 좋아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n&apos;est pas grave si c&apos;est la fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No me importa si este es el final</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist mir egal ob dies das Ende ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo bem se este for o fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть даже это станет моим концом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi importa se questa dovesse essere la fine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kore ga saigo ni nattatte ii</span></p><p begin="3:24.670" end="3:30.600" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.670" end="3:25.150">The</span> <span begin="3:25.150" end="3:25.500">en</span><span begin="3:25.500" end="3:25.550">d</span> <span begin="3:25.550" end="3:25.730">i</span><span begin="3:25.730" end="3:25.820">s</span> <span begin="3:25.820" end="3:26.070">here</span> <span begin="3:26.070" end="3:26.590">now,</span> <span begin="3:26.980" end="3:27.220">but</span> <span begin="3:27.350" end="3:27.670">my</span> <span begin="3:27.670" end="3:27.830">love</span> <span begin="3:27.830" end="3:28.320">still</span> <span begin="3:28.320" end="3:30.480">li</span><span begin="3:30.480" end="3:30.600">ves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终局已然降临 但我的爱永存</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終局已然降臨 但我的愛永存</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">終わりは今ここにある それでも私の愛はまだ生きている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금 끝이 다가왔지만, 내 사랑은 여전히 살아있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La fin est là maintenant mais mon amour vit toujours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El final está aquí ahora, pero mi amor aún vive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Ende ist nun hier doch meine Liebe lebt weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O fim está aqui agora, mas meu amor ainda vive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Конец уже здесь но моя любовь продолжает жить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La fine è qui ora ma il mio amore vive ancora</span></p><p begin="3:29.030" end="3:32.440" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:29.030" end="3:29.500">愛</span><span begin="3:29.500" end="3:29.630">で</span><span begin="3:29.740" end="3:30.140">応</span><span begin="3:30.140" end="3:30.310">え</span><span begin="3:30.450" end="3:30.630">て</span> <span begin="3:30.910" end="3:31.150">そ</span><span begin="3:31.150" end="3:31.290">れ</span><span begin="3:31.400" end="3:31.590">だ</span><span begin="3:31.590" end="3:31.800">け</span><span begin="3:31.800" end="3:31.940">の</span><span begin="3:31.940" end="3:32.440">夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用爱来回应我吧 仅仅是这样的梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">用愛來回應我吧 僅僅是這樣的夢境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Respond with love just that kind of dream</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑으로 대답해 줘 그저 그것뿐인 꿈</sp